{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_014nFh1pzK6E2sNfrwQNYRrn","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# 04: Booking and summary\n2\t\n3\t**What to build:** The selection becomes a booking kept in `sessionStorage`. `Continue` takes the customer to the summary (`Your tickets`), which lists each ticket with its price, a `Remove` button and the total; `Back` returns to the seat map with the selection intact and `Cancel` on the seat map clears the booking. The summary and checkout routes redirect to `/` without a matching booking.\n4\t\n5\t**Specification:** sections 3.1, 5.4, 5.6, 6, 9.3, 9.7.\n6\t\n7\t**Blocked by:** 03 — Seat selection, legend and selected-seats panel.\n8\t\n9\t**Status:** ready\n10\t\n11\t- [ ] AC-28 — Seats in rows 1–5 cost `25.00 PLN`.\n12\t- [ ] AC-29 — Seats in rows 6–10 cost `32.00 PLN`.\n13\t- [ ] AC-30 — Seats in rows 11–14 cost `39.00 PLN`.\n14\t- [ ] AC-31 — A couch costs `89.00 PLN` per couch, not per seat.\n15\t- [ ] AC-32 — Accessible seats cost `25.00 PLN`, like the rest of row 1.\n16\t- [ ] AC-33 — `Cancel` navigates to `/` and clears the selection.\n17\t- [ ] AC-34 — `Continue` navigates to `/screenings/:id/summary`.\n18\t- [ ] AC-35 — `Continue` does nothing when no seat is selected.\n19\t- [ ] AC-36 — Each selected item is listed with movie title, screening date, time, row number, seat description and price.\n20\t- [ ] AC-37 — A couch is described as `Couch <a>-<b>`; a single seat is described by its column number.\n21\t- [ ] AC-38 — The total line reads `Total: <sum> PLN` and equals the sum of the listed prices.\n22\t- [ ] AC-39 — `Back` returns to the seat map with the selection intact.\n23\t- [ ] AC-40 — `Confirm` navigates to `/screenings/:id/checkout`.\n24\t- [ ] AC-59 — The summary shows the title `Your tickets`.\n25\t- [ ] AC-60 — Each summary item has a `Remove` button that removes it from the booking and updates the total; removing the last item returns to the seat map.\n26\t- [ ] AC-67 — Every summary identifier in section 9.3 is present with the exact names and values given there.\n27\t- [ ] The booking survives a reload of the seat map and of the summary.\n28\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b57fd512-3185-49f1-a3f5-4ca4529fa7ab","uuid":"8d7bbc7c-5596-4c10-9e9e-288ce995582b","timestamp":"2026-10-15T08:43:26.191Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/workspace/project/spec/tickets/04-booking-summary.md","content":"# 04: Booking and summary\n\n**What to build:** The selection becomes a booking kept in `sessionStorage`. `Continue` takes the customer to the summary (`Your tickets`), which lists each ticket with its price, a `Remove` button and the total; `Back` returns to the seat map with the selection intact and `Cancel` on the seat map clears the booking. The summary and checkout routes redirect to `/` without a matching booking.\n\n**Specification:** sections 3.1, 5.4, 5.6, 6, 9.3, 9.7.\n\n**Blocked by:** 03 — Seat selection, legend and selected-seats panel.\n\n**Status:** ready\n\n- [ ] AC-28 — Seats in rows 1–5 cost `25.00 PLN`.\n- [ ] AC-29 — Seats in rows 6–10 cost `32.00 PLN`.\n- [ ] AC-30 — Seats in rows 11–14 cost `39.00 PLN`.\n- [ ] AC-31 — A couch costs `89.00 PLN` per couch, not per seat.\n- [ ] AC-32 — Accessible seats cost `25.00 PLN`, like the rest of row 1.\n- [ ] AC-33 — `Cancel` navigates to `/` and clears the selection.\n- [ ] AC-34 — `Continue` navigates to `/screenings/:id/summary`.\n- [ ] AC-35 — `Continue` does nothing when no seat is selected.\n- [ ] AC-36 — Each selected item is listed with movie title, screening date, time, row number, seat description and price.\n- [ ] AC-37 — A couch is described as `Couch <a>-<b>`; a single seat is described by its column number.\n- [ ] AC-38 — The total line reads `Total: <sum> PLN` and equals the sum of the listed prices.\n- [ ] AC-39 — `Back` returns to the seat map with the selection intact.\n- [ ] AC-40 — `Confirm` navigates to `/screenings/:id/checkout`.\n- [ ] AC-59 — The summary shows the title `Your tickets`.\n- [ ] AC-60 — Each summary item has a `Remove` button that removes it from the booking and updates the total; removing the last item returns to the seat map.\n- [ ] AC-67 — Every summary identifier in section 9.3 is present with the exact names and values given there.\n- [ ] The booking survives a reload of the seat map and of the summary.\n","numLines":28,"startLine":1,"totalLines":28}}}
