{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01VoMt2TYFfEva5oKfpL6Mzz","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# 06: Confirmation and booking lifecycle\n2\t\n3\t**What to build:** After a successful payment the customer sees the confirmation with their email address; `Continue` clears the booking and returns to `/`. The whole booking lifecycle from section 3.1 holds: it survives reloads, and every route guards against a missing or mismatched booking.\n4\t\n5\t**Specification:** sections 3.1, 8, 9.5.\n6\t\n7\t**Blocked by:** 05 — Checkout and payment.\n8\t\n9\t**Status:** ready\n10\t\n11\t- [ ] AC-48 — `/confirmation` shows `Payment successful` and `Your tickets will be sent shortly to <email>`; `Continue` navigates to `/` and clears the booking; the booking survives a reload via `sessionStorage`; entering the summary, checkout or confirmation without a matching booking redirects to `/`.\n12\t- [ ] AC-69 — Every confirmation identifier in section 9.5 is present with the exact names and values given there.\n13\t- [ ] Reloading `/confirmation` after paying still shows the confirmation.\n14\t- [ ] After `Continue`, the seat map of the same screening shows no selected seats and the checkout form of a new booking is empty.\n15\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b57fd512-3185-49f1-a3f5-4ca4529fa7ab","uuid":"d4c3a0b6-dbf5-4345-a404-d3dc43e9ff93","timestamp":"2026-10-15T08:43:26.991Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/workspace/project/spec/tickets/06-confirmation.md","content":"# 06: Confirmation and booking lifecycle\n\n**What to build:** After a successful payment the customer sees the confirmation with their email address; `Continue` clears the booking and returns to `/`. The whole booking lifecycle from section 3.1 holds: it survives reloads, and every route guards against a missing or mismatched booking.\n\n**Specification:** sections 3.1, 8, 9.5.\n\n**Blocked by:** 05 — Checkout and payment.\n\n**Status:** ready\n\n- [ ] AC-48 — `/confirmation` shows `Payment successful` and `Your tickets will be sent shortly to <email>`; `Continue` navigates to `/` and clears the booking; the booking survives a reload via `sessionStorage`; entering the summary, checkout or confirmation without a matching booking redirects to `/`.\n- [ ] AC-69 — Every confirmation identifier in section 9.5 is present with the exact names and values given there.\n- [ ] Reloading `/confirmation` after paying still shows the confirmation.\n- [ ] After `Continue`, the seat map of the same screening shows no selected seats and the checkout form of a new booking is empty.\n","numLines":15,"startLine":1,"totalLines":15}}}
